<p>
  Plausible Analytics counts page views, where visitors came from, their country and device, and
  these actions: picking a book up, opening it, opening Ask the library. It records which book,
  never what you ask. It sets no cookies; it sees your address and browser, and keeps only a hash
  of them that changes every day.
</p>
